Bootstrap: docker
From: rust:1.99.0-bookworm@sha256:114c7a4425406451c2866b6aafe69fe29b1b298832db1277d411ac73c82d04d6
Stage: build

%files
    Cargo.toml /build/Cargo.toml
    Cargo.lock /build/Cargo.lock
    README.md /build/README.md
    LICENSE /build/LICENSE
    src /build/src

%post
    cd /build
    cargo build --release --locked

Bootstrap: docker
From: debian:bookworm-slim@sha256:734a72b3d6142a71993b4bc580ca01d8ca687f77a2c422d96a961d3376b179bc
Stage: final

%files from build
    /build/target/release/vcf2phylip-rs /usr/local/bin/vcf2phylip-rs
    /build/LICENSE /usr/share/licenses/vcf2phylip-rs/LICENSE

%runscript
    exec /usr/local/bin/vcf2phylip-rs "$@"

%test
    /usr/local/bin/vcf2phylip-rs --version
    /usr/local/bin/vcf2phylip-rs --help

%labels
    License GPL-3.0-only
    Description VCF/BCF to FASTA and relaxed PHYLIP; M6 unvalidated container recipe
